It's. um. all in the data.

246
00:15:19.320 --> 00:15:21.368
Nobody else understands the data.

247
00:15:21.480 --> 00:15:24.529
Harper will want you. Just
get yourself to Moscow.

248
00:15:24.840 --> 00:15:26.888
<i>WOMAN: (IN FILM)
