computer screen anymore.

362
00:23:05.960 --> 00:23:09.487
You know what? If the job isn't right for
you. Jack. maybe it's time to move on!

363
00:23:24.000 --> 00:23:25.240
Paris.

364
00:23:26.560 --> 00:23:27.846
You and me.

365
00:23:29.240 --> 00:23:30.571
Okay?

