483
00:32:50.720 --> 00:32:51.846
Uh...

484
00:32:56.080 --> 00:32:57.206
Hello?

485
00:32:57.960 --> 00:33:00.247
Yeah. you know. I. um...

486
00:33:02.720 --> 00:33:04.370
<i>I don't think so. Cath.</i>

487
00:33:04.440 --> 00:33:06.681
<i>I think I'm gonna be tied
up longer than I thought.</i>

488
00:33:06.760 --> 00:33:07.966
I'm not. uh...

489
00:33:08.040 --> 00:33:09.451
